00:05:43.880 --> 00:05:49.360
It trains you to compare forward price to earnings across an entire industry rather than chasing headline

00:05:49.360 --> 00:05:54.960
momentum. The exercise also shows why verifying the same consensus data across multiple providers is

00:05:54.960 --> 00:05:59.940
required before committing capital. Before we get to the tools, let us review how yesterday's

00:05:59.940 --> 00:06:07.760
catalyst-driven flash trade on CLDX played out. We entered CLDX at $35.79 at market open.

00:06:08.140 --> 00:06:17.120
We exited at $34.38 at market close. That produced a 3.94% loss or $39.40 on the $1,000

00:06:17.120 --> 00:06:22.280
position. Alpha data was unavailable from the primary tracker for the exact holding window.

00:06:22.760 --> 00:06:28.400
